    ],
    "text": "364. (1) Any person (in this section referredto as the \u201coffender\u201d) who commits rape onanother person (in this section referred to asthe \u201cvictim\u201d) shall, except, in the casesprovided for in subsections (2) and (3), bepunished with rigorous imprisonment for a termnot less than seven years and not exceedingtwenty years and with fine, and shall in additionbe ordered to pay compensation of an amountdetermined by court, to the victim for theinjuries caused to such person.",
